   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Multidimensional poverty Analysis 2019 Report Update</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen kommer att bidra till att uppdatera Multi-dimensional poverty analysis((MDPA) 2019 f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5;nga den samtida utvecklingssituationen i landet (i vilken utstr&#xe4;ckning fattigdomen &#xf6;kade eller minskade) som input f&#xf6;r &#xe5;rlig planering och ny strategiutveckling f&#xf6;r 2022-2026.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is to update Multi-dimensional poverty analysis((MDPA) done in 2019 to capture the  contemporary development situation in the country (to what extent poverty increased or decreased) as input for annual planning and new strategy development for 2022-2026.</narrative>
  </description>
